{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"RCA: the SSM rotation runbook treated SSM as the only post-rotation write target, but several GitHub Actions secrets are operational mirrors of SSM-backed credentials. Rotating only SSM leaves scheduled/CI workflows reading stale GitHub secret values until manually synced. RED evidence: tests/unit/test_secret_rotation_runbook.py initially failed because infra/runbooks/ssm-secret-write-only.md had no Actions mirror inventory or SSM-to-gh secret set commands. Fix adds that inventory, copy-paste sync commands, and a timestamp-based drift-audit note; no new CI-provider-only mechanism added.","timestamp":1788899147355008001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Implemented and merged as Gerrit change 2848: rotation runbooks now document GitHub Actions secret mirrors, SSM-to-gh sync commands, and verification checks.","timestamp":1788909765017005001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1788839556194303001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"0c939f90-90f5-4951-b75e-187a059734e7","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"899f-f964-327c-4c47"},{"link_uuid":"a1f0b3cb-b52d-4eeb-9ba4-5b1b209463b1","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"e03f-e258-626b-4bd0"},{"link_uuid":"941abbb3-8ea2-495e-8d2b-346de0835f46","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"0b87-e6f8-002a-4130"},{"link_uuid":"c865b9c0-5397-446e-ba41-538cdf91834e","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"eee7-23de-d83d-4fc0"},{"link_uuid":"1cff149b-1b24-487a-ba2a-58c44f469f83","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"d3d3-7017-d4e1-4fcf"},{"link_uuid":"d5789150-c972-42b4-a230-a8fb7f6cffaa","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"d11a-5824-16c4-4896"}],"description":"## Context\nDuring the 2026-09-07 rotation (auspicial-wily-warbler), SSM was treated as the single point of rotation, but two GitHub Actions repo secrets mirroring SSM values went stale: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and JIRA_API_TOKEN kept their 2026-08-12 values until manually synced on 2026-09-08. Workflows reference: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, GERRIT_SSH_PRIVKEY, JIRA_API_TOKEN, OPENAI_API_KEY, REBAR_BOT_SIGNING_KEY (+ JIRA_URL/JIRA_USER non-secrets). Any secret that lives in BOTH SSM and GitHub Actions must be rotated in both, or CI fails with stale credentials after the old value is revoked.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] A documented inventory maps each GitHub Actions secret to its SSM source (or marks it GitHub-only), in the ops runbook that owns rotation (infra/runbooks/).\n- [x] The rotation runbook includes an explicit GitHub Actions sync step (gh secret set from SSM) with a copy-paste command per mapped secret.\n- [x] Optional (evaluate): a drift check that compares gh secret updated_at against SSM parameter LastModifiedDate and flags mirrors older than their source, surfaced through an existing operational channel (no new CI-provider-only mechanism; must have an operation-linked or in-process fallback per project.portability).\n\n## Verification\n- Runbook review: rotating any mapped secret following the runbook leaves no stale mirror.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/runbooks/ssm-secret-write-only.md","reason":"Document the GitHub Actions secret mirror inventory and sync commands for SSM-backed rotations."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_secret_rotation_runbook.py","reason":"Regression test that the rotation runbook names the GitHub Actions mirror mapping and copy-paste SSM-to-GitHub sync commands."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","0b87-e6f8-002a-4130"],["relates_to","d11a-5824-16c4-4896"],["relates_to","d3d3-7017-d4e1-4fcf"],["relates_to","e03f-e258-626b-4bd0"],["relates_to","eee7-23de-d83d-4fc0"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"d1674f30-0bd4-4b44-9f9e-9b2c62228f07","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f116-c8d0-1e69-4361","ticket_type":"task","title":"Secret-rotation procedure must include GitHub Actions secret sync","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ef2da819-e870-4eb2-8ca0-2759888035fa","33e4b882-f01d-4274-aa82-8b5522ba37c7","b3d41a99-76b3-40bd-bf43-03a205800241","d02d5b39-50e5-44ad-8a5e-75033f2981e4","379e3501-dfeb-48db-b6ba-dac8955480a0","a1f0b3cb-b52d-4eeb-9ba4-5b1b209463b1","941abbb3-8ea2-495e-8d2b-346de0835f46","c865b9c0-5397-446e-ba41-538cdf91834e","71e7f352-ba24-435e-8de0-5fcb5d3c3ae4","f0deb3b3-97c4-4c24-828b-3b80c187b163","1cff149b-1b24-487a-ba2a-58c44f469f83","d1674f30-0bd4-4b44-9f9e-9b2c62228f07","82bbb703-7b8f-4ae9-8430-f1b3a3d48f31","d5789150-c972-42b4-a230-a8fb7f6cffaa","85916027-3ef6-4e20-840d-b518eb1872a6"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788912517080069001,"uuid":"d84452fc-8769-470c-aa0c-e2ecc9484c89"}